\subsection{The knowledge part}

The knowledge part consists of the questions of the course's example
exam, improved where needed and translated (\cref{prior-knowledge});
its chunk is empty until they are selected.
Unlike the concept inventories discussed in \cref{inventory-discussion},
the exam questions may be committed to this repository and shown here
in full---that transparency is part of why they were chosen.
When the items are added, each must be preceded by a comma---in both
quizzes something comes before them: the background items in the start
quiz, the preparation item in the end quiz.
To keep each item's placement independent of the quiz it appears in, we
number the knowledge items from position 11; Canvas orders by position
and gaps are fine.
